  explanation: "This component stores the a list of prefabs which are the main managers
    of the game, as these objects are now separated objectsfrom the player it self.
    \n\nThis includes elements like the main inventory list manager, faction system,
    mission manager, dialog manager, etc....\n\nJust press the button Add Main Managers
    to Scene and they will be spawned on the scene, so you can configure the values
    on these manager and use the button Update Main Managers Info to Prefabs, to
    update the new info configured. "
