  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4d04db457cd86be41aeaaecd4be42d6d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  explanation: 'This feature manager has been removed, as there is an improved main
    settings manager, for the player and AI.


    Go to the Build Player component,
    on this same gameObject, and open the button ''Show Setting List'' and set the
    value on any of the settings and use the button ''Apply'' on the right of such
    value to apply such setting.


    You can also set all the values on that list
    as needed and use the button on the bottom to apply all of them at once on the
    button ''Apply Current Settings''.'
